{"answerArea":{"calculator":true,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"The formula for the derivative of $\\arctan(x)$ is:\n\n$\\dfrac{d}{dx}[\\arctan(x)]=\\dfrac{1}{1+x^2}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's start by finding $h'(x)$:\n\n$\\begin{align}\nh'(x)\u0026=\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[\\arctan\\left(-\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{1}{1+\\left(-\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)^2}\\cdot\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[-\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{-1}{2\\left(1+\\dfrac{x^2}{4}\\right)}\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Now we evaluate $h'(x)$ at $\\blueD{x=-7}$:\n\n$\\begin{align}\nh'\\left(\\blueD {-7}\\right)\u0026=\\dfrac{-1}{2\\left(1+\\dfrac{(\\blueD {-7})^2}{4}\\right)}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{-1}{2\\left(\\dfrac{53}{4}\\right)}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=-\\dfrac{2}{53}\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion, $h'\\left(-7\\right)=-\\dfrac{2}{53}$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"$h(x)=\\arctan\\left(-\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right)$\n\n$h'\\left(-7\\right)=$ [[☃ expression 1]]\n\n*Use an exact expression.*","images":{},"widgets":{"expression 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"answerForms":[{"considered":"correct","form":false,"key":0,"simplify":false,"value":"-\\frac{2}{53}"}],"buttonSets":["basic","prealgebra"],"functions":["f","g","h"],"times":false},"static":false,"type":"expression","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
